# Web Domain

`[rule: web]` — Constraints for website package.

## Allowed Paths
- `website/`

## Scope
- TanStack Start and router configuration
- React components and pages
- TailwindCSS styling
- shadcn/ui components

## Design Philosophy
Minimal and elegant. Let content and functionality speak. Remove visual noise.

## Rules

### Routing & Architecture
- Use file-based routing (`src/routes/`)
- Import Scene packages from workspace
- Canvas demos must handle WebGPU unavailability gracefully

### Visual Design (Non-Negotiable)
- Primary color: black (`#000`) for light mode, white (`#fff`) for dark mode
- Grayscale: neutral (Tailwind `neutral-*` scale)
- No visible borders: `border-*` classes must be `border-transparent` or `border-0`
- Semantic dividers allowed but invisible (`border-transparent`, `opacity-0`, or no border style)
- No decorative lines; use whitespace and typography hierarchy
- No decorative colors; avoid gradients, decorative shadows, accent colors
- No rounded corners on containers
- Use spacing and font weight for hierarchy
- Backgrounds: only `bg-white`, `bg-black`, or `bg-neutral-*` when needed for contrast

### Exceptions (Require Justification)
- Input fields may have subtle borders for affordance
- Focus rings for accessibility are required
- Canvas borders acceptable during WebGPU debugging only

### Future Test/Demo Files
- All new tests/demos for Scene packages must be in `website/`
- Do not create standalone HTML files in `packages/*/tests/`
- Create routes under `website/src/routes/demos/<package>/`
